#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt>Kwlan was unable to<p align=\"center\"><b>%1</b></p>This may be caused "
"by system misconfiguration e.g. absence of the utility called or incorrect "
"parameters passed. Please check this and try again."
msgstr ""
"<qt>Dat <p align=\"center\"><b>%1</b> weer Kwlan nich mööglich.</p>Dat mag "
"an en leeg Systeeminrichten liggen (dat opropen Programm is gor nich "
"installeert, a.B.) oder an leeg Parameters. Prööv dat bitte un probeer dat "
"denn man nochmaal ut.</qt>"

